     "label": "🏠 The full address",
     "html": "<p>Write your \"full address\", from the smallest to the biggest, as if you were to receive a letter from another planet:</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><b>Via Garibaldi 5 → Municipality of Pinerolo → Metropolitan City of Turin → Piedmont Region → Italian Republic → European Union → Europe → Earth</b></p>\n<p>Each \"step\" has its own tasks: the bigger it is, the more people its decisions affect. This is the same as the principle of <b>subsidiarity</b>: decisions are taken as close as possible to the citizens, and you \"go up\" to the higher level only when needed.</p>",
